      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 568062550,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Hi Chris,\n\nCoverity reported the following (legitimate) bug:\n```\n** CID 1482084:  Uninitialized variables  (UNINIT)\n/builds/wireshark/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-selfm.c: 1392 in dissect_fmdata_frame()\n\n\n________________________________________________________________________________________________________\n*** CID 1482084:  Uninitialized variables  (UNINIT)\n/builds/wireshark/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-selfm.c: 1392 in dissect_fmdata_frame()\n1386                         tm.tm_year = tvb_get_guint8(tvb, offset+2) + 100;\n1387                         tm.tm_hour = tvb_get_guint8(tvb, offset+3);\n1388                         tm.tm_min = tvb_get_guint8(tvb, offset+4);\n1389                         tm.tm_sec = tvb_get_guint8(tvb, offset+5);\n1390     \n1391                         datetime.nsecs = (tvb_get_ntohs(tvb, offset+6) % 1000) * 1000000;\n>>>     CID 1482084:  Uninitialized variables  (UNINIT)\n>>>     Using uninitialized value \"tm.tm_isdst\" when calling \"mktime\". [Note: The source code implementation of the function has been overridden by a builtin model.]\n1392                         datetime.secs = mktime(&tm);\n1393     \n1394                         proto_tree_add_time(fmdata_tree, hf_selfm_fmdata_timestamp, tvb, offset, 8, &datetime);\n1395     \n1396                         offset += 8;\n1397                     }\n```\nBest regards,\nPascal.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6722527,
            "username": "pquantin",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Pascal Quantin",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9bf49edc6acae0eca821eb90309381794fb4fbea4f3fb7c2378428862ddbb430?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/pquantin"
